    excerpt: "The first institutional cheque for driven founders in the New Nordics: idea stage, no traction required. Teams supported from idea to seed and beyond since 2017 150+ The most we invest as the first ticket €1.5M Follow-on capital raised by the portfolio companies €450M+ The first decisions shape everything Your first hire. Your first customers. The product you choose to build. At the idea stage, a few decisions can change the entire company. The right customers open the door to the next hundred. The wrong ones can leave you building a product with nowhere to go. We have been investing at this stage in the New Nordics since 2017. Our funds are small by design: the right help matters more than the biggest cheque. We typically invest €750k, with first tickets from €100k to €1.5M. You get a team and a community of more than 500 portfolio founders and key people, a call or message away. Whatever you are working through, someone has probably been there. Across more than 150 startup journeys, we have seen first ideas, small and big pivots, seed rounds, growth rounds and exits. Whatever comes, we don’t panic. A first cheque that goes further 38 idea-stage companies taken to seed. More than twice the next firm in our comparison. Helping founders reach the next stage is the work we are here to do. Companies whose first round was below €1M, counting those that subsequently raised a round above €1.5M. The top 20 of 33 firms are shown; peers are anonymised. Icebreake",
