    summary: "Rapyd is a global payments platform that helps businesses accept payments, send payouts and access global payment methods through one unified solution. Businesses need a way to grow globally without rebuilding payments and financial systems in every market. Rapyd solves this by unifying global payments, payouts and financial services into a single platform that can be embedded into any application. We started our journey as a mobile payments company but quickly saw a bigger problem … In 2016, we set out to build an eWallet that would allow users to access global payment methods without relying on traditional banking. What we found was a fragmented system with multiple integrations, local services, licensing requirements and regulatory complexity in every market. It wasn’t scalable. After we were unable to find a partner that had already built this global payments infrastructure, we realized the greater opportunity in building it ourselves and making it available to companies and innovators worldwide to liberate global commerce. The Rapyd team is dedicated to helping our customers build bold by giving them the freedom to decide how and where they do business. Our investors include some of the world’s most globally recognized venture capital firms and strategic investors.",
